              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, javelins and shield. May exchange javelins for throwing spear or thrusting spear (+2 pts). Light Cavalry. Carolingian French: every other unit of Pueri may exchange javelin and shield for bow. (Shieldwall p.73)</characteristic>
